  "title": "VIZSLA SILVER PROVIDES ADDITIONAL UPDATE ON SITUATION IN CONCORDIA - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (April 6, 2026) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”) today provided the following update on the situation in Concordia, Sinaloa. The Company confirms that nine colleagues have now been found deceased. It remains in close contact with the family of one colleague who remains missing and continues to […]",
